  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building public-private partnerships to boost circular economy on the tourist island of Boa Vista in Cabo Verde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Joint Program (JP) aims to accelerate the transition to a circular green economy by mobilizing partnerships to implement circular economy approach in Boa Vista, specifically focused on integrated solid waste management.  The project involves a  south-south triangular  cooperation model with Cabo Verde, the city of Bilbao and the United Nations system working through the United Nations Joint SDG Fund and the United Nations Local2030 Coalition.</narrative>
  </description>
